@startuml 08-resilience-state
' Copyright 2026 Muhammad Salah
' SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title PortCloak — Transfer State Machine (bad-connection tolerance)

[*] --> Planning
Planning --> Connecting : job ready
Connecting --> Transferring : handshake ok
Connecting --> Backoff : connect error (retryable)
Transferring --> Verifying : all parts sent
Transferring --> Interrupted : connection dropped
Transferring --> Backoff : transient I/O error

Interrupted --> Resuming : checkpoint exists\n& within retry budget
Resuming --> Transferring : re-open from last\ngood offset/part
Backoff --> Connecting : delay elapsed\n(exp backoff + jitter)
Backoff --> Failed : retry budget exhausted\nor non-retryable

Verifying --> Committed : checksum match
Verifying --> Backoff : checksum mismatch\n(re-send bad part)

Committed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Interrupted
  Checkpoint persisted to disk:
  { key, uploadId, partsDone[], offset, etag }
  Survives app restart -> job is resumable
  even after PortCloak is reopened.
end note

note right of Backoff
  CircuitBreaker may trip to OPEN
  after N consecutive failures;
  cools down before half-open probe.
end note

@enduml
